+# Krea2 character LoRA visual QA
+
+Validated in a real Chromium browser against `http://127.0.0.1:8189/` on 2026-07-11.
+
+## Results
+
+| Viewport | Layout | Horizontal document overflow | Rows | Result |
+| --- | --- | --- | ---: | --- |
+| 1280 × 800 | Four columns | No | 11 | Pass |
+| 768 × 900 | Two columns | No | 11 | Pass |
+| 390 × 844 | One column | No | 11 | Pass |
+
+The final browser pass reported zero console errors. The mobile header wraps within the viewport, while the existing global tab strip keeps its own horizontal scrolling region. All 11 character-name values were empty after QA; `Takahashi Kurumi` is placeholder text only.
+
+The resolution control was revalidated after implementation at the same three viewports. It loaded 1224×1632 from the workflow, completed a browser save round trip through 896×1152, restored 1224×1632, and preserved both configured character mappings. No document-level horizontal overflow or console errors were observed.
+
