+- `.superloopy/evidence/frontend/20260711-krea2-lora/krea2-lora-1280.png`
+- `.superloopy/evidence/frontend/20260711-krea2-lora/krea2-lora-768.png`
+- `.superloopy/evidence/frontend/20260711-krea2-lora/krea2-lora-390.png`
